  data: {
    LLM: "Be extremely cautious about opening the pot. If your hand is marginal, checking is safer to avoid the 'Match the Pot' penalty.\n\nSince everyone knows Deuces are wild, 'Trips' are the new 'Pair.' Don't bother staying in the hand without at least a natural pair or a wild card.\n\nPositional opening: If you are the dealer and it's checked to you, opening is less risky because you have seen everyone else's lack of interest. However, if you open and lose, you pay. Use the threat of the 'Match' to force folds if you have a strong hand.",
    Player: "Be extremely cautious about opening the pot. If your hand is marginal, checking is safer to avoid the 'Match the Pot' penalty.\n\nSince everyone knows Deuces are wild, 'Trips' are the new 'Pair.' Don't bother staying in the hand without at least a natural pair or a wild card.\n\nPositional opening: If you are the dealer and it's checked to you, opening is less risky because you have seen everyone else's lack of interest. However, if you open and lose, you pay. Use the threat of the 'Match' to force folds if you have a strong hand.",
